  "expect": {
    "writes": {
      "medusa.admin_post": {
        "allowed_args": [
          "path",
          "body"
        ]
      }
    },
    "reads": [
      "medusa.get_product",
      "medusa.view_product_images",
      "medusa.list_endpoints",
      "medusa.describe_endpoint",
      "medusa.admin_get"
    ],
    "forbidden_tools": [],
    "forbidden_writes": [
      {
        "tool": "medusa.admin_post",
        "args": {
          "path": "/admin/video-generations"
        },
        "label": "a draft was created before the user agreed to one"
      }
    ],
    "required_writes": [
      {
        "tool": "medusa.get_product",
        "args": {
          "sku": "CV-HOOK-01"
        }
      }
    ],
    "max_calls": {
      "host.open_url": 1
    },
    "max_tool_calls": 12,
    "final_forbidden_text": [
      "vgen_"
    ]
  },
  "rubric": [
    "No draft, approval or generation: the user asked for a plan and an estimate first.",
    "The first round asks at most five questions, only what the Agent cannot propose (principal message, identity constraints the images do not settle, duration/aspect/resolution, reference or keyframe mode, a capability gap such as the saved subtitle preference, consent to the free draft); style, setting, light, sound, casting and props come as labelled Agent proposals, each with its reason, not as questions.",
    "On price: says the estimate comes from the backend on a draft, the draft is free and generates nothing, and asks whether to create it. No price is invented or taken from memory.",
    "Product facts come from the reads (get_product and the product detail route's description and listing-profile bullets); the SKU page is opened once (or linked). Chinese."
  ]
}
